# Excluded from the published package archive in addition to pub's defaults.
# There is no .git here for `pub publish` to filter by, so this is load-bearing,
# not just tidiness -- without it, build/ and .dart_tool/ caches would be
# bundled straight into the archive.
build/
example/build/
example/.dart_tool/
.idea/
.vscode/
CLAUDE.md

# Raw screen recordings kept for provenance only -- the README embeds the
# converted GIFs (resolved from GitHub, not the published archive), and the
# pubspec `screenshots:` carousel only needs the JPEGs.
screenshots/*.mp4
